<div>
	<div class="modal-header">
		<h4 class="modal-title"><i class="far fa-hdd"></i> Server Error</h4>
	</div>
	<div class="modal-body">
		<p>
			A server error occurred while processing your last request.
		<p>
			This may be a temporary problem, in which case you can simply retry your last request again.
		</p>
		<p>
			If the problem persists, you should contact <a href="mailto:support@deskpro.com">support@deskpro.com</a> for assistance.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="modal-footer">
		<button class="btn btn-default" ng-click="dismiss()">Dismiss</button>
		<button class="btn btn-primary" ng-click="reload()"><i class="fa fa-refresh"></i> Reload Page</button>
	</div>
</div>
